OL,3,GNEWSAPaedophile jailed for inciting
OL,4,Achild in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paedophile who incited a child in the
OL,7,FUS to engage in sexual activity has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for five years and nine
OL,9,Fmonths.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said 750
OL,12,Findecent images of children were found
OL,13,Fon phones, a computer and hard drive
OL,14,Fbelonging to Andrew Scott when the
OL,15,F40-year-old was arrested at his home in
OL,16,FCarlton in 2023.
OL,18,FOfficers found he had been "sending
OL,19,Fmessages of a sexual nature to a child
OL,20,Fover Snapchat".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
