OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as a custodial sentence, Scott
OL,7,F- who was sentenced at Nottingham Crown
OL,8,FCourt on 6 November - will be placed on
OL,9,Fthe sex offenders register for life and
OL,10,Fmade the subject of a ten-year Sexual
OL,11,FHarm Prevention Order.
